<title>UK: Dixons H1 pretax profits rise by 53 pct.</title>
<headline>Dixons H1 pretax profits rise by 53 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>28 weeks ending November 9</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		9.0		    vs 5.9</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.40		   vs 2.05</p>
<p> Pretax		     57.5		   vs 37.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,045		  vs 844</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 54 and 57 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Dixons Group Plc</p>
</text>
